Output docs/media/agents.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type "luneta luneta" Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s

Ctrl+j
Sleep 1500ms

Tab
Sleep 2500ms

Down@600ms 2
Sleep 2500ms
Up@600ms 2
Sleep 1500ms

Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Ctrl+o
Type "d"
Sleep 1s
